    </div>

    <div class="nt-intro__content">
      <span class="nt-intro__eyebrow">Certified NanoTint Installer</span>
      <h2 class="nt-intro__title">Philadelphia's Curved Glass, Skylights, and Specialty Windows Finally Have a Solution.</h2>
      <p class="nt-intro__lead">Traditional film can't go on curved glass. NanoTint liquid coating can. DryWired NanoTint in Philadelphia is applied with a brush, roller, or spray applicator, then cures into an optically clear hard coating bonded to glass, acrylic, polycarbonate, and other surfaces traditional adhesive film cannot cover.</p>
      <p class="nt-intro__body">That matters in a city with arched glass in historic rowhomes, museum skylights over sensitive collections, healthcare atriums at Penn Medicine and Jefferson, and boat glass around Penn's Landing. NanoTint window film in Philadelphia gives those specialty surfaces UV and heat protection without forcing a glass replacement.</p>
      <div class="nt-intro__creds">
        <div class="nt-intro__cred">
          <svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10" stroke="#81AB4C" stroke-width="2"/><path d="M8 12l3 3 5-5" stroke="#81AB4C" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
          Certified NanoTint Installer
        </div>
        <div class="nt-intro__cred">
          <svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10" stroke="#81AB4C" stroke-width="2"/><path d="M8 12l3 3 5-5" stroke="#81AB4C" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
