    <h2 class="nt-products__title">DryWired Liquid NanoTint Products for Philadelphia Specialty Glass</h2>
    <p class="nt-products__sub">NanoTint window film in Philadelphia is available as clear liquid coating, curved-glass coating, color tint versions, and specialty-surface formulas for glass, plastic, acrylic, and polycarbonate.</p>
  </div>

  <!-- ROW 01 - Liquid NanoTint Clear (image LEFT) -->
