      <span class="nt-pl-row__eyebrow">Optically Clear · 99% UV Block · Any Surface</span>
      <h3 class="nt-pl-row__heading">Liquid NanoTint Clear — 99% UV Block Without Changing How the Glass Looks</h3>
      <p class="nt-pl-row__body">Liquid NanoTint Clear is the flagship DryWired coating for glass that needs protection without a tinted appearance. It blocks 99%+ of ultraviolet radiation, reduces infrared heat transmission, and improves comfort while maintaining near-full visible light through the clear version.</p>
      <p class="nt-pl-row__body">Because it is liquid applied, the same product family can serve flat glass, curved glass, plastic, acrylic, and polycarbonate after surface review. For Philadelphia, that makes it useful on historic arched windows, skylights over art or furnishings, hospital atriums, greenhouse panels, and specialty glass where replacement would be expensive or visually disruptive.</p>

      <div class="nt-pl-row__specs">
        <div class="nt-pl-row__spec"><span class="nt-pl-row__spec-val">99%</span><span class="nt-pl-row__spec-label">UV Block</span></div>
        <div class="nt-pl-row__spec"><span class="nt-pl-row__spec-val">Clear</span><span class="nt-pl-row__spec-label">Optically Clear</span></div>
        <div class="nt-pl-row__spec"><span class="nt-pl-row__spec-val">Both</span><span class="nt-pl-row__spec-label">Interior + Exterior</span></div>
        <div class="nt-pl-row__spec"><span class="nt-pl-row__spec-val">Liquid</span><span class="nt-pl-row__spec-label">Liquid Applied</span></div>
      </div>

      <div class="nt-pl-row__pdfs">
        <span class="nt-pl-row__pdfs-label">NanoTint Technical Documents</span>
        <ul class="nt-pl-row__pdf-list">
          <li><a href="/resources/nanotint-window-film-brochure-philadelphia.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="nt-pl-row__pdf-link"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"/><polyline points="14 2 14 8 20 8"/></svg> Liquid NanoTint Brochure</a></li>
